          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>MiiCoffee GF64 coffee grinder is small all purpose coffee grinder. It covers all ranges of coffee beans, e.g. espresso, filter brewing and Turkish coffee. The grinder comes with stainless steel 64mm flat burrs. GF64 delivers very low retention. The rubber bellow can be used to push air through the grinding chamber and ensure minimal retention of grounds. The exit chute is equipped with plasma generator (aka Ionizer). It reduces static to non-existent. <br/><br/></p>"
          }
