    "b3ea4f7a-079c-4a6e-90f1-5e09150ad5ed": {
      "type": "multicolumn",
      "blocks": {
        "10aedefa-e669-4598-bbb3-0923ca687568": {
          "type": "column",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/withgrinder_3_2_ea3f94f9-e7d9-4da9-9ac3-87724a306731.jpg",
            "title": "MiiCoffee Apex Espresso Machine",
            "text": "<p>MiiCoffee Apex is an entry-level semi-automatic espresso machine. It has a compact footprint for new home baristas. It uses stainless steel inside out extensively. Apex comes with 550ml stainless steel boiler for brewing espresso. Apex brews espresso at 9 bar. It comes with barometer showing the extra brewing pressure. PID allows you to change brewing temperature. When it starts brewing it also display the brewing time.</p>",
            "link_label": "Buy Now",
            "link": "shopify://products/miicoffee-apex-espresso-machine"
          }
        },
        "column_BBzfwk": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/overview3_0947e477-5db5-4574-a8fe-d39e788b5dba.jpg",
            "title": "DF54 Single Dose Coffee Grinder",
            "text": "<p>MiiCoffee DF54 single dose coffee grinder is entry level flat burr coffee grinder. It integrated the best elements from DF64 II but is made into a smaller package. The three seated position for the upper burr carrier integrated wave spring makes the grinding chamber absolutely stable. At the same time it achieves minimal retention at the new level. The exit chute is equipped with plasma generator (aka Ionizer) that reduces static to non-existent. DF54 comes with custom made stainless steel 54mm flat burrs that deliver a fluffy grind with minimal clumping and consistent particle size distribution. The integrated Anti-popcorn cover help increase grinding speed.</p>",
            "link_label": "Buy Now",
            "link": "shopify://products/miicoffee-df54-single-dose-coffee-grinder"
          }
        },
        "template--18695795638567__b3ea4f7a-079c-4a6e-90f1-5e09150ad5ed-column-1": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/overview_3_2_98d32ff0-86e8-4af1-8ed0-f5ac9b2c0a30.jpg",
            "title": "DF83 Gen 2 Single Dose Coffee Grinder",
            "text": "<p>MiiCoffee DF83 Gen 2 Single Dose Coffee Grinder is a professional-grade grinder designed for single dosing. It features custom-made 83mm Red Titanium espresso flat burrs that produce a fluffy grind with minimal clumping and excellent particle size consistency. The DF83 II incorporates design improvements inspired by the DF64 II and DF54, resulting in a more refined and efficient grinding experience. It also includes a large-capacity hopper for those who prefer not to single dose or need to grind larger amounts of coffee. The redesigned grinding chamber is a major upgrade from the original DF83. It features four strong springs mounted around four guide posts to maintain precise alignment between the upper and lower burrs, ensuring consistent performance across the entire grind range. </p>",
            "link_label": "Buy Now",
            "link": "shopify://products/miicoffee-df83-coffee-grinder"
          }
        },
        "template--18695795638567__b3ea4f7a-079c-4a6e-90f1-5e09150ad5ed-column-2": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/overview3.jpg",
            "title": "DF83V Variable Speed Single Dose Grinder",
            "text": "<p>MiiCoffeeDF83V Variable Speed Single Dose Coffee Grinder is a significant upgrade from its predecessor, the DF83. The horizontal design of DF83V is specifically engineered to minimize retention. The high power brushless DC motor allows for a wide range of speed control, from 300 to 1600 RPM, providing optimal grinding performance for your coffee beans. This powerful DC motor's high torque is capable of crushing even the lightest coffee beans, eliminating the common stall issue found in other DC motor grinders. Choose between 83mm espresso DLC burrs or brewing DLC burrs. </p>",
            "link_label": "Buy Now",
            "link": "shopify://products/miicoffee-df83v-single-dose-coffee-grinder"
          }
        },
        "ce4935e7-c8f0-44a7-90cd-745a308362eb": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/overview_3_2_64539be7-cf41-4555-9814-d4e8c693c2f7.jpg",
            "title": "DF64 II Single Dose Coffee Grinder",
            "text": "<p>MiiCoffee DF64 II single dose coffee grinder is complete re-design of the old populate DF64 grinder. It integrated the best elements from DF64V and DF83. The three seated position for the upper burr carrier integrated wave spring makes the grinding chamber  absolutely stable. At the same time it achieves minimal retention at the new level.  The exit chute is equipped with plasma generator (aka Ionizer) that reduces static to non-existent. The integrated Anti-popcorn cover help increase grinding speed.</p>",
            "link_label": "Buy Now",
            "link": "shopify://products/mii-df64-single-dosing-coffee-grinder"
          }
        },
        "69bdbdd0-960e-46c7-9e40-67ab915f8b32": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/overview_3_2_6d13c19b-6430-44c0-bc9b-32210d3faceb.jpg",
            "title": "DC63 Single Dose Coffee Grinder",
            "text": "<p>MiiCoffee DC63 single dose coffee grinder is small all purpose coffee grinder. It covers all ranges of coffee beans, e.g. espresso, filter brewing and Turkish coffee. The grinder comeswith Red Titanium 63mm conical burrs. DC63delivers very low retention. The rubber bellow can be used to push air through the grinding chamber and ensure minimal retention of grounds. The magnetic design of exit chute helps achieve consistent grinds cross all ranges.<br/><br/></p>",
            "link_label": "Buy Now",
            "link": "shopify://products/miicoffee-dc63-single-dose-coffee-grinder"
          }
        },
        "e350f2ab-aada-4252-9168-d52c9202c5a6": {
          "type": "column",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/overview_3_2_e9f22e67-03ec-455b-bb16-d271a98e00d5.jpg",
            "title": "DF83 Single Dose Coffee Grinder",
            "text": "<p>MiiCoffee DF83 coffee grinder is all purpose grinder working for a range of brew methods e.g. pour over, espresso, cold brew etc. DF83 is rated best coffee grinder between $500 to $1000. Thanks to its large burr size DF83 is suitable for commercial environment. It now comes with plasma generator (aka Ionizer) that reduces static.</p>",
            "link_label": "Buy Now",
            "link": "shopify://products/miicoffee-df83-coffee-grinder"
          }
        },
        "de2b5e8f-61fa-435a-bc38-06084b93b54f": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/overview_3_2_c96082aa-77c5-41ee-b2e3-3fd4cb70c131.jpg",
            "title": "PT2 Portable Electric Coffee Grinder",
            "text": "<p>MiiCoffee PT2 portable coffee grinder is a small coffee grinder that can be carried around easily. With the full metal construction it is guaranteed to last longer. The stainless steel conical burrs that deliver a consistent grind. External 85 steps adjustment provides grinding sizes that covers espresso, pour over coffee to French press. The built-in 800mAh battery can last 25 to 30 grinds. It supports most fast charging USB-C chargers. It also shuts off automatically when there are no coffee beans left in the hopper. If you are a home barista who wants a good quality portable coffee grinder this one is for you.<br/><br/></p>",
            "link_label": "Buy Now",
            "link": "shopify://products/miicoffee-pt2-portable-electric-coffee-grinder"
          }
        }
      },
